      "question": "<ol class=\"parts\"><li>Using the definition of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh x\"></span> in terms of exponentials, prove that<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"4\\sinh^3x+3\\sinh x\\equiv\\sinh3x\" data-display=\"true\"></div><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li><li>Hence solve the equation<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sinh3x=19\\sinh x\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>giving your answers as simplified natural logarithms where appropriate.</p><span class=\"marks\">(5)</span></li></ol>",
