      "question": "<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)=\\tanh^{-1}\\left(\\frac{3-x}{6+x}\\right)\\qquad|x|&lt;\\frac{3}{2}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Show that<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f&#x27;(x)=-\\frac{1}{2x+3}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li><li>Hence determine <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f^{\\prime\\prime}(x)\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></li><li>Hence show that the Maclaurin series for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)\"></span>, up to and including the term in <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2\"></span>, is<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\ln p+qx+rx^2\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r\"></span> are constants to be determined.</p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li></ol>",
