      "id": "exam/edexcel-9fm0-02-2024-june/q5",
      "question": "<p>The locus <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span> is given by</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"|z-4|=4\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>The locus <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"D\"></span> is given by</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\arg z=\\frac{\\pi}{3}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Sketch, on the same Argand diagram, the locus <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span> and the locus <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"D\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li></ol><p>The set of points <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\"></span> is defined by</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A=\\left\\{z\\in\\mathbb C:|z-4|\\leqslant4\\right\\}\\cap\\left\\{z\\in\\mathbb C:0\\leqslant\\arg z\\leqslant\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"2\"><li>Show, by shading on your Argand diagram, the set of points <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></li><li>Find the area of the region defined by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\"></span>, giving your answer in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\\pi+q\\sqrt3\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q\"></span> are constants to be determined. <span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li></ol>",
